1: <!doctype html>
2: <html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
3: <title>Pocket Startup</title>
4: <meta name="description" content="Pocket Startup is an AI agent that builds your idea as a tiny app, breaks it on purpose, fixes it from its own trace, and tells you if it is worth building.">
5: <meta property="og:title" content="Pocket Startup">
6: <meta property="og:description" content="Should you build it? An agent that builds, breaks, fixes, prices and judges your startup idea. Every claim links to proof.">
7: <meta property="og:type" content="website">
8: <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
